' ============================================
' DEPENDENCY FLOW (Clean Architecture - Dependency Rule)
' ============================================

note as N5
    **The Dependency Rule (Clean Architecture)**
    
    Source code dependencies must point INWARD:
    Presentation → Application → Domain → Infrastructure
    
    **Why?**
    • Domain (business logic) has ZERO dependencies
    • Easy to test domain in isolation
    • Easy to change UI, DB, frameworks
    • Business rules are protected
    
    **How?**
    • Dependency Inversion Principle (SOLID)
    • Interfaces/Abstractions at boundaries
    • Infrastructure implements domain interfaces
end note

