    **🏗️ SENIOR-LEVEL ARCHITECTURE PATTERNS**
    
    |= Icon |= Layer / Concept |
    | 🎨 PRESENTATION | UI Layer - Pages, Routes (thin, no logic) |
    | 🎯 APPLICATION | Use Cases - Controllers, Hooks (orchestration) |
