    | 🏗️ INFRASTRUCTURE | Technical Details - DB, Logger, Cache |
    | ☁️ EXTERNAL | Third-party APIs - Gemini, Gmail |
    
    |= Arrow Color |= Dependency Type |
    | <color:#FF6F00><b>orange bold</b></color> | Network boundary (HTTP/WebSocket) |
    | <color:#1976D2><b>blue bold</b></color> | Domain collaboration (service → service) |
    | <color:#388E3C><b>green bold</b></color> | Application → Domain (controller → service) |
    | <color:#FBC02D>yellow</color> | Middleware pipeline (Chain of Responsibility) |
    | <color:#0288D1>light blue</color> | Data access (Repository pattern) |
    | <color:#4CAF50>green</color> | Database queries (with RLS) |
    | <color:#CE93D8>purple</color> | Infrastructure utilities (Logger, Config) |
